  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 60,
    "summary": "David says that the Lord has scattered His people—The Lord places Ephraim at the head and makes Judah His lawgiver.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "O God, thou hast cast us off, thou hast scattered us, thou hast been displeased; O turn thyself to us again.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "1 Ne. 10:14; 2 Ne. 25:15 (14–18); D&C 101:13."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast made the earth to tremble; thou hast broken it: heal the breaches thereof; for it shaketh.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast shewed thy people hard things: thou hast made us to drink the wine of astonishment.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "HEB staggering."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast given a banner to them that fear thee, that it may be displayed because of the truth. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "2 Ne. 29:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "That thy beloved may be delivered; save with thy right hand, and hear me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "IE beloved people."
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "Ps. 108:6 (6–13)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 44
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "God hath spoken in his holiness; I will rejoice, I will divide Shechem, and mete out the valley of Succoth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 99,
            "end": 106,
            "text": "Gen. 33:17."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Gilead is mine, and Manasseh is mine; Ephraim also is the strength of mine head; Judah is my lawgiver;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 93,
            "end": 101,
            "text": "Gen. 49:10."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 9
          },
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 31
          },
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 53
          },
          {
            "start": 87,
            "end": 89
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Moab is my washpot; over Edom will I cast out my shoe: Philistia, triumph thou because of me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "2 Sam. 8:14."
          },
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 64,
            "text": "OR over Philistia will I triumph. See Ps. 108:9."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 7
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who will bring me into the strong city? who will lead me into Edom?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 22
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Wilt not thou, O God, which hadst cast us off? and thou, O God, which didst not go out with our armies?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4
          },
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 27
          },
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 56
          },
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 69
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Give us help from trouble: for vain is the help of man.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 38
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Through God we shall do valiantly: for he it is that shall tread down our enemies.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
